Location: Japan (Tokyo, Kawasaki)
Join Fortinet, a cybersecurity pioneer with over two decades of excellence, as we continue to shape the future of cybersecurity and redefine the intersection of networking and security. At Fortinet, our mission is to safeguard people, devices, and data everywhere. We are currently seeking dynamic Finance Manager to contribute to the success of our rapidly growing business.

As a Finance Manager, you will:

- Reporting to APJ Finance Director based in Beijing, China;
- Providing business support and advice to Japan finance and other functions, including R&D, Sales, Technical support etc. to ensure company policies and procedures are strictly followed;
- Liaising with suppliers, customers and 3rd party service providers and providing feedback and advice as required, so to have them well understand Fortinet policies and procedures and act accordingly;
- Working closely with APAC finance team as well as US tax, GL, FP&A and cost accounting teams to meet the information request and reporting requirements;
- Performing financial analysis and providing financial reports/supports as per required;
- Other duties as requested.

We Are Looking For:
An insightful and influential collaborator to join our team. We encourage you to apply for this position if you have the following qualities:

- Degree in accounting, finance or related disciplines and chartered/certified accountant is preferred;
- 5- 10 years’ experience in full spectrum of accounting/finance function, preferably with a US multinational company;
- 3-5 years’ experience in a managerial role;
- In-depth knowledge and experience in US and Japanese GAAP;
- Hands on experience in MS Office and computerized accounting systems;
- Experienced with Oracle is preferred;
- Several years of international/regional exposure;
- Strong communication skill and being able to communicate with people at all levels;
- Fluent in both English and Japanese;
- A fast learner and team player and able to work independently and with tight timeline;
- High level of integrity and positive attitude;
- Hands on and detail oriented

Why Join Us:
At Fortinet, we embrace diversity and inclusivity. We encourage applications from diverse backgrounds and identities. Explore our welcoming work environment designed for a rewarding career journey with an attractive Total Rewards package to support you with your overall health and financial well-being. Join us in bringing solutions that make a meaningful and lasting impact to our 660,000+ customers around the globe.

We will only notify shortlisted candidates.

Fortinet will not entertain any unsolicited resumes, please refrain from sending them to any Fortinet employees or Fortinet email aliases. Should any Agency submit any resumes to Fortinet, these resumes if considered, will be assumed to have been given by the Agency free of any related fees/charges.

